<% content_for :title, "Help" %>
<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 md:px-8">
  <p class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-algae-900 dark:text-algae-300">Help</p>
  <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Never lose a follow-up again.</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#3d4742] dark:text-[#C6CFC9]">Trellixe turns any interaction into a kept relationship: mark who came, get reminded the next morning, log the call. Three steps, every week.</p>
  <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
    <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9DDE0] bg-white p-5 dark:bg-[#131B17] dark:border-white/10" open>
      <summary class="cursor-pointer font-display font-semibold">How do I add someone from the street?</summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#3d4742] dark:text-[#C6CFC9]">Open Contacts → New contact. Name, number, and one line of context (“pray for mum's surgery”) is enough. Tag them so they land on Sunday's guest list.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9DDE0] bg-white p-5 dark:bg-[#131B17] dark:border-white/10">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer font-display font-semibold">How does Sunday check-in work?</summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#3d4742] dark:text-[#C6CFC9]">Open the event and mark guests as attended. That one tap queues Monday's follow-up tasks with the event context attached.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D9DDE0] bg-white p-5 dark:bg-[#131B17] dark:border-white/10">
      <summary class="cursor-pointer font-display font-semibold">Where do Monday reminders come from?</summary>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#3d4742] dark:text-[#C6CFC9]">Attendance creates follow-up tasks automatically. Each volunteer sees their own list on the dashboard with due dates and history.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</div>
